  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "165",
  "tip": "<p>When you see a requirement for resilience to a <i>zone outage</i> with <i>automatic failover</i> choose a regional high availability configuration rather than replicas or backups that need manual promotion or restore.</p>",
